#: plugin_timeadjust.cpp:65
msgid "Adjust Time && Date..."
msgstr "Podesi vrijeme i datum..."

#: clockphotodialog.cpp:168
msgid "Determine time difference with clock photo"
msgstr "Utvrđivanje razlika u vremenu sa satom fotografija"

#: clockphotodialog.cpp:170
msgid "Load different photo"
msgstr "Učitaj drugu fotografiju"

#: clockphotodialog.cpp:180
msgid ""
"If you have a photo in your set with a clock or another external time source "
"on it, you can load it here and set the indicator to the (date and) time "
"displayed. The difference of your internal camera clock will be determined "
"from this setting."
msgstr ""
"Ako imate fotografiju sa satom ili drugim spoljnjim izvorom vremena, možete "
"ga ovdje učitati i postaviti indikator datuma i vremena. Razlika u odnosu na "
"sat s fotoaparata će se odrediti iz postavki."

